  "question": "Within a 20 kilometers radius, where can I find a fast food restaurant as I head from Hotel UMass, Amherst, MA to Mowry Conservation Area, Smithfield, RI?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-72.527124 42.391734)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-71.552762 41.920455)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE amenity = 'fast_food'\nAND ST_DWithin(pois.geometry, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-72.527124 42.391734)',4326)::geography, 20000)\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-72.527124 42.391734)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5);\n",
